  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "电路写对之后，仍有三个地方会坏。",
   "spoken": "电路写对之后，仍有三个地方会坏。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.695,
   "speechEnd": 4.178
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "第一个，是可信设置。",
   "spoken": "第一个，是可信设置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 4.712,
   "speechEnd": 6.27
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "Groth16 这类方案，要先做一次设置，生成证明密钥和验证密钥。",
   "spoken": "Groth16 这类方案，要先做一次设置，生成证明密钥和验证密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 6.68,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 6.78,
   "speechEnd": 12.365
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "设置过程会产生秘密，俗称有毒废料。谁留着它，谁就能伪造任意证明。",
   "spoken": "设置过程会产生秘密，俗称有毒废料。谁留着它，谁就能伪造任意证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 12.82,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 12.82,
   "speechEnd": 19.066
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "所以设置用多方仪式。每人贡献一部分，只要有一人诚实销毁自己那份，秘密就拼不回来。",
   "spoken": "所以设置用多方仪式。每人贡献一部分，只要有一人诚实销毁自己那份，秘密就拼不回来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 19.44,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 19.44,
   "speechEnd": 27.345
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "按 ECC 的公告，Zcash 早期方案的设置产物里，多出了一些证明者用不到的元素。",
   "spoken": "按 ECC 的公告，Zcash 早期方案的设置产物里，多出了一些证明者用不到的元素。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 27.82,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 27.911,
   "speechEnd": 34.061
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "拿到它们，就能把一个证明，改造成另一个陈述的有效证明，凭空增发 ZEC。",
   "spoken": "拿到它们，就能把一个证明，改造成另一个陈述的有效证明，凭空增发 ZEC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 34.44,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 34.537,
   "speechEnd": 40.69
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "团队在 2018 年内部发现，升级换掉参数，2019 年才公开。团队称没有发现被利用的证据。",
   "spoken": "团队在 2018 年内部发现，升级换掉参数，2019 年才公开。团队称没有发现被利用的证据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 41.14,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 41.14,
   "speechEnd": 49.178
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第二个，是证明器和 zkVM 本身。",
   "spoken": "第二个，是证明器和 zkVM 本身。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 49.6,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 49.694,
   "speechEnd": 52.856
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "2025 年 1 月，Plonky2 的查找表用 0 填充，恶意证明者总能证明一个固定的等式。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 1 月，Plonky2 的查找表用 0 填充，恶意证明者总能证明一个固定的等式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 53.26,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 53.26,
   "speechEnd": 60.366
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "2025 年 7 月，ZKsync 的一个承诺漏掉了部分内部状态，无效的输入能伪装成有效。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 7 月，ZKsync 的一个承诺漏掉了部分内部状态，无效的输入能伪装成有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 60.76,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 60.867,
   "speechEnd": 68.241
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "安全委员会紧急升级，暂停证明生产，没有损失。",
   "spoken": "安全委员会紧急升级，暂停证明生产，没有损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 68.66,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 68.757,
   "speechEnd": 72.743
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "第三个，是验证器。",
   "spoken": "第三个，是验证器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 73.2,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 73.2,
   "speechEnd": 74.688
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "证明里的数，都在一个有限域里，到了阶 r 就绕回 0。",
   "spoken": "证明里的数，都在一个有限域里，到了阶 r 就绕回 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 75.1,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 75.1,
   "speechEnd": 79.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "就像钟面，13 点和 1 点，指在同一个位置。",
   "spoken": "就像钟面，13 点和 1 点，指在同一个位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 80.28,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 80.28,
   "speechEnd": 84.096
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "验证器不检查公开输入小于 r，攻击者把 x 换成 x 加 r，证明照样有效。",
   "spoken": "验证器不检查公开输入小于 r，攻击者把 x 换成 x 加 r，证明照样有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 84.5,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 84.593,
   "speechEnd": 92.089
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "合约却把它当成一个新数。只能用一次的记录，就能再用一次。",
   "spoken": "合约却把它荡成一个新数。只能用一次的记录，就能再用一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 92.48,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 92.48,
   "speechEnd": 98.135
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，钟面只有 12 格，有限域的阶是一个极大的数。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，钟面只有 12 格，有限域的阶是一个极大的数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 98.54,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 98.644,
   "speechEnd": 104.704
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "snarkjs 生成的验证器，过去同时接受这两个值。",
   "spoken": "snarkjs 生成的验证器，过去同时接受这两个值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 105.16,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 105.16,
   "speechEnd": 109.507
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "所以验证器要校验全部公开输入都在域内，并跟踪上游的安全公告。",
